; Regression test for issue #3278: a written zero teaches no precision.
;
; A precision of 0 that an amount written in the journal has taught is
; honored by the balance check, while a commodity whose precision nothing
; has taught is checked at the precision of its costs (see 1114.test).  A
; zero is written without decimals in every currency, so 0 EUR teaches EUR
; nothing, and the remainder of 0.01 EUR in the second transaction is
; still caught.

2015/03/01 * Account opened, still empty
    Assets:Wise:EUR                            0 EUR = 0 EUR
    Equity:Opening

2015/03/05 * Payee
    Assets:Bank                                $1.00 @  1.02 EUR
    Income:Revenue                            -$1.00 @  1.01 EUR

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 16:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 14-16:
> 2015/03/05 * Payee
>     Assets:Bank                                $1.00 @  1.02 EUR
>     Income:Revenue                            -$1.00 @  1.01 EUR
Unbalanced remainder is:
                   0
Amount to balance against:
            1.02 EUR
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
